== Overview ==
The '''Dual Claw Laser Toilet''' is an extremely powerful [[Enemies|toilet]] that can stun [[units]] with three different abilities. It can be found on [[Nightmare Mode]] and usually event modes. 

== Appearance ==
The Dual Claw Laser Toilet has a very similar appearance to the [[Small Scientist Toilet]], and is relatively large, with a similar size to the [[Flamethrower Toilet|Flamethrower Toilet]] or the [[Toxic Skull Toilet|Toxic Skull Toilet]].

== Waves ==
=== Nightmare Mode ===
*Wave 50: x1 (??? HP)

== Strategy ==
Since this toilet is extremely powerful, use high DPS units such as [[Upgraded Titan Cinemaman]] or [[Upgraded Titan Cameraman|Upgraded Titan Cameraman]]. This toilet also has the ability to stun (as with most units in nightmare) so you should also bring units that can block stuns, such as [[Upgraded Titan Speakerman|Upgraded Titan Speakerman]]. It is also recommended to bring [[Camera Repair Drone|Camera Repair Drone]] as well as the [[Medic Cameraman|Medic Cameraman]] to heal stuns from this toilet. [[Shield Cameraman|Shield Cameraman]] may also be useful against this toilet, as it can deflect its stuns directly back at the Dual Claw Laser Toilet.

== Trivia ==

* This toilet is based off the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Laser_Scientist_Skibidi_Toilet Laser Scientist Skibidi Toilet]
* The arm on the right is the same arm has [[Welder Toilet|Welder toilet]] and is a black version of the [[Forklift Toilet|Forklift Toilet's]] yellow arm.

